TEST 08_minimal_cyl — 150 MeV protons in water, cylindrical scoring
2026-06-15 / Niels Bassler

Same physics as 00_minimal (electromagnetic only, no nuclear reactions).
Scoring uses Geometry Cyl instead of Geometry Mesh.

Primary fluence is constant along depth in the on-axis R bin (ir=0).
Energy deposition integrated over all R bins should match 00_minimal's
single-voxel result (within normalization by voxel volume).

Run:
  build_rel/bin/openshieldhit -v tests/cases/08_minimal_cyl/
